@format 1
@id processing.retry
@title Retry failed job
@area Processing
@entry input
@summary Apply retry policy to a failed running item and release it back to pending state when another attempt is allowed.
@flow TB
@related processing.run-job, processing.complete
@tag processing
@tag retry

@alias job = Cadroue.ShellEngine.LJob
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Job failure requests retry <input>
- Receive the failure reason from FFmpeg exit or a job exception @ job.LJobRetryStart(...)
> policy

[policy] Check retry policy <decision>
- Confirm retry is enabled and increment the runner-local retry count @ job.LJobRetryStart(...)
? "Another retry is allowed" > release
? "Retry is disabled or exhausted" > final

[release] Release claimed work <decision>
- Move the owned running record back to scheduled state with the retry message @ schedule.LScheduleItemRelease(...)
? "Release succeeds" > requeued
? "Release fails" > final

[requeued] Retry scheduled <output>
= The work item is pending and may be claimed again.

[final] Retry unavailable <output>
> map:processing.complete
